scenario.en:
// Before: bounded labels
http_requests_total{method, route, status}
//   ~6 methods x ~40 routes x ~5 status classes = ~1200 series

// After: someone adds userId
http_requests_total{method, route, status, userId}
//   the service has ~2,000,000 active users

What is the order of magnitude of the new series count, and what happens to Prometheus?

